comment.narrative:
Between July and September 2022, 125 contacts have subscribed or visited the APLE Chatbot. Of these, 25 were identified as male and 20 as female while the rest were unidentified. There was no available data for age segregation when users contacted anonymously. 
38 contacts opted in through Chatbot on APLE Facebook page and the rest opted in through Chatbot on APLE website. 43 contacts subscribed to the bot as login users while the rest were visitors. 
it is achieved under target due to chat bot V2 is still under developing and APLE are not able to promote Chat Bot V2 Yet.;
